      "image": "game-brief-assets/2026-09-22-game-news-castlevania-0.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "game-news-ff7-level",
      "title": "《最终幻想7：启示》将提供可选自动升级",
      "date": "2026-09-21",
      "summary": "据总监采访，进入新区域时玩家可选择提升至推荐等级，也能保留传统探索与养成方式。",
      "source": "游民星空",
      "url": "https://www.gamersky.com/news/202609/2214128.shtml",
      "image": "game-brief-assets/2026-09-22-game-news-ff7-level-0.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "game-news-trails-record",
      "title": "《空之轨迹 the 2nd》Steam在线峰值创新高",
      "date": "2026-09-21",
      "summary": "游民援引SteamDB数据称，同时在线峰值达到15,331人，超过前作14,295人的纪录。数字为报道时快照。",
      "source": "游民星空",
      "url": "https://www.gamersky.com/news/202609/2214089.shtml",
      "image": "game-brief-assets/2026-09-22-game-news-trails-record-0.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "game-news-lisa-controller",
      "title": "PlayStation公布Lisa联名限量手柄",
      "date": "2026-09-21",
      "summary": "游民报道，联名DualSense计划10月30日上市，部分市场10月2日开启预购；国行安排尚未核验。",
      "source": "游民星空",
      "url": "https://www.gamersky.com/news/202609/2214115.shtml",
      "image": "game-brief-assets/2026-09-22-game-news-lisa-controller-0.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "game-news-blackspace",
      "title": "《红色沙漠》团队谈自研引擎选择",
      "date": "2026-09-21",
      "summary": "开发者在采访中表示，自研Blackspace引擎便于掌控功能与更新节奏，并从设计初期考虑多平台和不同游戏类型。",
      "source": "游民星空",
      "url": "https://www.gamersky.com/news/202609/2214013.shtml",
      "image": "game-brief-assets/2026-09-22-game-news-blackspace-0.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "game-news-neuro",
      "title": "TGS展台展示脑波操作游戏体验",
      "date": "2026-09-21",
      "summary": "游民转述现场体验：《NeuroWizards》让玩家通过集中注意力充能、脸部朝向瞄准和眨眼施法。这是展会演示，非普及产品。",
      "source": "游民星空",
      "url": "https://www.gamersky.com/news/202609/2214114.shtml",
      "image": "game-brief-assets/2026-09-22-game-news-neuro-0.jpg"
    },
    {
